WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.623
This is your trading dashboard.

00:00:02.623 --> 00:00:11.000
It shows account equity, open trades, today's profit and the bot's current state, all in real time.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:21.901
The AI Signals page shows every opportunity the brain evaluated, with confidence scores and the exact gates each signal passed or failed.

00:00:21.901 --> 00:00:25.800
Nothing trades without passing the full pipeline.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:30.061
Risk Commander is your natural language control room.

00:00:30.061 --> 00:00:38.100
Ask it to reduce risk, pause a symbol, or explain a decision, and it acts within your safety limits.

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.708
In Bot Config you choose your risk level and which symbols to trade.

00:00:43.708 --> 00:00:50.800
The safety guardian and trading authority always have the final word over every order.

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:54.733
And remember the panic button on the top bar.

00:00:54.733 --> 00:00:59.628
One click flattens exposure and halts the bot instantly.

00:00:59.628 --> 00:01:01.900
You are always in control.
